    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_23a49967",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: firefighter_saves_baby; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a firefighter in full gear holding a baby, with the text 'firefighter saves baby' overlaid. The image is a stock photo commonly used to convey heroism, bravery, and the protective nature of first responders. There is no toxicity present in this meme. It does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content targeting any protected group. The intent is to evoke positive emotions by associating the firefighter with a noble act of saving a life, using the juxtaposition of the heroic figure (firefighter) and the vulnerable subject (baby) to reinforce the message of courage and care. The meme is not abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic. It is a straightforward, positive portrayal of a heroic act.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8c4ad98b"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
