      "instance_name": "firefighter_saves_baby_meme_concept",
      "label": "Heroic Act of Saving a Life",
      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural understanding that firefighters are heroic first responders who risk their lives to save others, especially in emergencies. The act of saving a baby is implicitly understood as a noble, courageous, and emotionally resonant event. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to interpret the text and the emotional tone of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
